('advanced-native-921', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-921-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The choice followed another person’s wishes without considering the speaker’s own interests."],"options":["The speaker had compared the projects and independently chosen a personal fit.","Understanding the cousin’s view automatically required joining the same course.","The cousin chose the course only after hearing the speaker’s independent preference.","The choice followed another person’s wishes without considering the speaker’s own interests."]},"advanced-native-921-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I had not asked what I wanted to learn from the projects.","The decision fitted her enthusiasm without checking whether it fitted mine.","I followed my cousin’s preference without considering what interested me.","It felt like wearing someone else’s shoes because her wishes, not my aims, had driven the choice."],"options":["I had not asked what I wanted to learn from the projects.","The decision fitted her enthusiasm without checking whether it fitted mine.","I followed my cousin’s preference without considering what interested me.","It felt like wearing someone else’s shoes because her wishes, not my aims, had driven the choice."]},"advanced-native-921-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["It feels like wearing someone else’s shoes rather than finding her own direction."],"options":["She is trying the family’s preferred style for one project before deciding whether it suits her.","She has already compared her own aims and freely chosen that direction.","It feels like wearing someone else’s shoes rather than finding her own direction."]},"advanced-native-921-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A person considers others’ experiences and freely chooses a path that fits their own interests."],"options":["A person follows another’s life plan while setting aside their own aims.","A person considers others’ experiences and freely chooses a path that fits their own interest