('advanced-native-922', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-922-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["No; the speaker avoided an argument while retaining a specific concern."],"options":["No; the speaker rejected the venue outright and refused any further talk.","Yes; the late finishing time had already been changed before agreement.","No; the speaker avoided an argument while retaining a specific concern.","Yes; agreeing in the meeting proves the concern had already disappeared."]},"advanced-native-922-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I wanted to keep the peace, while leaving room to raise my concern privately.","Agreement at that moment helped the meeting continue without closing the issue for me.","I chose a quieter setting for the concern rather than arguing in front of everyone.","I wanted to avoid an argument there and discuss the late finish afterwards."],"options":["I wanted to keep the peace, while leaving room to raise my concern privately.","Agreement at that moment helped the meeting continue without closing the issue for me.","I chose a quieter setting for the concern rather than arguing in front of everyone.","I wanted to avoid an argument there and discuss the late finish afterwards."]},"advanced-native-922-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["I tried to keep the peace for the moment without pretending the rota issue was settled."],"options":["Avoiding a public argument means no later conversation is needed.","I tried to keep the peace for the moment without pretending the rota issue was settled.","The pause proves both roommates now agree on the rota."]},"advanced-native-922-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every underlying disagreement has been resolved."],"options":["Every underlying disagreement has been resolved.","The way calm was maintained still matters.","Open conflict was avoided or reduced in that situation."]},"advanced-native-922-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I agreed to keep the peace, but please keep my late-finish concern in the follow-up record."],"options":["I agreed to keep the peace, but please keep my late-finish concern in the follow-up record.","So the quiet meeting means we can erase the concern already raised?","Let us record complete enthusiasm because nobody argued publicly."]},"advanced-native-922-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We could keep the peace by planning a short film followed by a story session, so neither group’s interest is pushed aside. Let us agree the length of each part together.","To keep the peace, I suggest giving both activities a place in the event rather than asking one group to pretend it has changed its preference. We can discuss how much time each part needs."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
